You've been hiding those wicked talents all these years.

01:22:34.130 --> 01:22:39.240
Good afternoon, ladies.

01:22:40.380 --> 01:22:43.300
Thank you, as usual, for turning up so enthusiastically.

01:22:44.340 --> 01:22:46.700
Now, I have a list of tasks that need doing,

01:22:46.840 --> 01:22:49.280
so if you'll gather round, I'll ask for volunteers.

01:22:50.840 --> 01:22:53.020
Here we go.

01:22:55.390 --> 01:22:56.350
Excuse me.

01:22:57.360 --> 01:23:00.000
Good afternoon, my dear. We're here, ready.

01:23:00.030 --> 01:23:11.680
and willing. Good afternoon. Now, pew polishing. Two volunteers, please. Miss Wilson and Miss

01:23:11.680 --> 01:23:30.000
Barber. Thank you. Right. Changing the flowers. Mrs. Dawson and, yeah, Mrs. Andrews. Now,

01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:38.590
on my shiny brass where I'm sure they do mrs. Warden and miss Harvey

01:23:38.590 --> 01:23:53.230
no the altar cloth needs changing and my tableware mrs. Barrett ah yes now this

01:23:53.230 --> 01:24:00.000
needs quite a bit of work on it can I have a volunteer to clean the church hall toilet

01:24:00.000 --> 01:24:18.100
The toilet area adjacent to the organ loft.

01:24:18.100 --> 01:24:21.920
I think it's about time to give us a thorough going over.

01:24:21.920 --> 01:24:23.340
So if you two ladies...

01:24:23.340 --> 01:24:25.940
Excuse me, excuse me, excuse me, excuse me, excuse me.

01:24:25.940 --> 01:24:30.000
Excuse me, what are you doing?

01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:35.040
I've come to help with the church cleaning for that dishy vicar.

01:24:35.040 --> 01:24:42.360
I've forgotten all about church cleaning. I was supposed to take hyacinth church cleaning.

01:24:42.360 --> 01:24:48.230
Guess who's in the deep and murky then. I've told you, you've got to take an aggressive line.

01:24:48.230 --> 01:24:50.960
I will. I rather think I will.

01:24:50.960 --> 01:24:53.680
I mean, even when you're sober.

01:24:53.680 --> 01:24:57.560
Oh, I don't know about sober.

01:25:13.530 --> 01:25:17.230
up there that the vicar's wife wants removing so i said i'd do it

01:25:17.230 --> 01:25:22.300
it needs someone with a good head for height someone with a longer skirt

01:25:22.300 --> 01:25:26.660
rose i forbid you to go up that ladder wearing that skirt

01:25:26.660 --> 01:25:30.000
do you want me to take it off then

01:25:31.240 --> 01:25:37.000
course not. Though, I doubt if anybody had noticed the difference.

01:25:37.000 --> 01:25:51.280
I must. Chad, where have you been? Oh, here and there.

01:25:51.280 --> 01:26:00.000
Onslow, I hope you haven't been leading him astray. It was only our first attempt. We got nowhere near as far as astray.

01:26:04.570 --> 01:26:07.170
Now you're here, Onslow, you can take Rose home.

01:26:07.490 --> 01:26:09.310
Rose? What's she doing here?

01:26:09.920 --> 01:26:13.080
She volunteered to help with the church cleaning.

01:26:13.800 --> 01:26:15.000
Where is she then?

01:26:15.430 --> 01:26:16.310
She's over there.

01:26:36.590 --> 01:26:38.730
In my regards.

01:26:38.730 --> 01:26:40.770
Isn't it a lovely day?

01:26:40.770 --> 01:26:41.770
Oh, yes.

01:26:41.770 --> 01:26:43.850
Do you think the rains need dusting?

01:26:43.850 --> 01:26:44.850
Rain? Dusting?

01:26:44.850 --> 01:26:47.410
Well, they look rather dull in this kind of life.
